WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Delivery maturity changes the first move.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.880
A team with reliable pipelines
and resettable data can test AI-generated

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:11.360
candidates quickly. A team waiting
for vendor access may benefit

00:00:11.427 --> 00:00:15.720
first from reviewed scenario design
while the environment improves.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:20.600
The readiness profiles illustrate
effort; they do not approve adoption.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.440
Infrastructure, test data, dependency
control, ownership and reviewer capacity

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.720
all matter. Assess
the selected application

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.000
and workflow before committing
to a date or a benefit.
